text.en:
Upon finishing a reload within 3.8 seconds of a Kill:
The next Weapon Hit within #e${7+#d} seconds applies Jolt. 

//Applied Jolt inherits the weapon's <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] /> (only applies to the Jolted target) and Weapon Damage Buffs
//TODO: Commenting these out until I look into it more

enhanced (
var d = 1
#e Buff Duration is increased by 1 second.
)

Finishing a reload within 3.8 seconds of a Weapon Kill grants Voltshot for #e${7+#d} seconds.

While Voltshot is active, your next Weapon Hit applies <arc/>Jolt and consumes the buff. 

//Applied Jolt inherits the weapon's <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] /> (only applies to the Jolted target) and Weapon Damage Buffs
//TODO: Commenting these out until I look into it more

enhanced (
var d = 1
#e Buff can be held 1 second longer.
)
